MMS - Module Management System (Make for VMS) 
	Provides an easy way to be sure that executables are current.

CMS - Code Management System
	Helps track software development and maintenance.

LSE - Language Sensitive Editor
	Editor that is able to help write code by giving the user to option to
	allow the editor to expand and set up the fram of a program and the user
	to fill in the details.

SCA - Source Code Analyzer
	This is a source code cross-reference and static analysis tool that  is
	designed to aid developers in understanding the complexities of 
	large-scale software systems.

PCA - Performance and Coverage Analyzer 
	A software development tool that helps you analyze the run-time behavior
	of application programs. Can pinpoint execution bottlenecks and other
	performance problems in user programs.


