> What is the standard configuration?  (HD, RAM,software, etc)

	Configuration range from a diskless system with 8 MB memory
	and the monochrome framebuffer and a 19" monitor to the
	24 MB system with the PXG turbo (see graphics answer) and
	an RZ55 (332 MB).

	The base system includes a thinwire Ethernet adapter and
