To change the between-line spacing in a paragraph you need to modify the 
style for Body Text.  I am assuming you know nothing -- most certainly 
incorrect (you probably knmow more about DECwrite than I do) but I
didn't want to leave anything out.

Pull down on the Style menu pulldown and go over to the Paragraph Style
submenu and pick Body Text.  Modify the Leading option (defaults to 2
I think) to be something else.  Hit Apply and you will see the spacing
between the lines change. When you are happy with the result, push OK
and this will save those options for the document you are working on.

This may not be The Best or Definitive Way but it does work for me.

Fred


